    "directions": [
      "Combine egg white, heavy whipping cream, lemon juice, orange juice, strawberry syrup, Campari and Frangelico in a cocktail shaker.",
      "Dry shake (without ice) to emulsify the ingredients, then add ice and shake vigorously until chilled.",
      "Add soda water to the bottom of a chilled Collins glass, then fine-strain three-quarters of the shaken ingredients over the soda water.",
      "Allow to sit for 3 minutes, then pour the Cynar into the Collins glass. (It will sink to the bottom.)",
      "Top with the remaining blend in the cocktail shaker.",
      "Garnish with birthday cake sprinkles."
    ],
